cessful mission. Will you focus on offensive firepower, defensive armor, or something else entirely? </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Unique Encounters:</strong> Uncover the mysteries of the alien presence through random events, story fragments, and challenging decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Risk vs. Reward:</strong> Push your luck to reap greater rewards, but beware - one wrong move could end your run and doom humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/3d9b9c89c17e2a1afc9e88c9c9403da3.poster.avif?t=1759247910\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/3d9b9c89c17e2a1afc9e88c9c9403da3.webm?t=1759247910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/extras/3d9b9c89c17e2a1afc9e88c9c9403da3.mp4?t=1759247910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unique blend of deckbuilding with real-time combat, and immersive 3D visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform and modify cards during combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Procedurally generated lunar core ensures no two runs are alike </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Deep, strategic gameplay with endless deck-building possibilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Roguelite system that rewards both skill and strategy with persistent meta-progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Good luck! We're all counting on you.</h2>","developers":["Cooler Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"descr